\pard\plain 
{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
CPP-API: Abstract interface for logger implementations. {\b Assimp} provides a default implementation and uses it for almost all logging stuff ('{\b DefaultLogger}'). This class defines just basic logging behavior and is not of interest for you. Instead, take a look at #DefaultLogger. \par
}}
